  "title": "India's Democracy in Crisis: Rahul Gandhi's Allegations",
  "summary": "India's political landscape is under intense scrutiny as Congress leader Rahul Gandhi accuses the government of undermining democracy through allegations of electoral manipulation, institutional corruption, and the destruction of democratic principles. The event highlights ongoing tensions between political movements and the ruling party.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Rahul Gandhi claims India is no longer a democracy, citing allegations of electoral anomalies and political manipulation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Rahul Gandhi argues that Congress's actions in 2014, which involved significant political investment, led to the destruction of democracy in India.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Rahul Gandhi also claims that the Election Commission's role in validating the legitimacy of the election was compromised.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
